## [2.3.0] - 2026-08-12

### Fixed

* Fix Firefox 153 compatibility (replaced placeholder gecko ID)
* Add visual feedback when clipboard copy fails
* Remove invalid bare attribute from details element
* Add input validation for dimension settings and parse duration correctly
* Save default values to storage when reset button is clicked
* Prevent XSS in address bar initial URL render
* Add 15-second iframe load timeout with automatic error state
* Validate preconnect URLs in Chrome background
* Cancel rAF polling loop on successful iframe load
* Remove transform from fadeInCenter animation to fix rendering
* Add tabs.onUpdated listener for same-tab navigation cleanup
* Block dangerous URI schemes (javascript:, data:, etc.) in link preview

### Changed

* Use clientWidth/clientHeight instead of innerWidth/innerHeight for layout accuracy
* Cap navigation history at 50 entries
* Filter preconnect to only http(s) URLs
* Use inset:0 instead of 100vw/100vh on overlay

---

## [2.2.3] - 2026-05-18

### Fixed

* Make build script compatible with macOS stock Bash 3.2
* Serialize DNR rule updates to prevent interleaving race conditions
* Add try/catch around new URL() in navigateTo to handle malformed URLs
* Add .catch() to all runtime.sendMessage and storage calls
* Guard against sender.tab being undefined in Chrome message handler
* Use per-tab Map instead of single previewingUrl in Firefox background
* Scope Chrome DNR rules to only the previewing tab IDs
* Use non-throwing DOM lookups in teardown path of toggleDisableParentPage
* Hoist pauseStyle to module scope to prevent style element leaks
* Use targeted sed replacement in build to avoid corrupting string literals
* Scope Firefox header stripping to previewing tabs only
* Persist previewingTabIds to session storage for service worker restarts

### Changed

* Use getElementById instead of querySelector for content element
* Limit stack trace parsing in log() to only the caller frame
* Prune timeoutIDs Map entries after timeout fires
* Only activate content_iframe.js inside the preview iframe
* Dynamically register/unregister Firefox webRequest listeners

---

## [2.2.0] - 2026-05-17

### Added

* GitHub Actions release workflow for automated builds

### Fixed

* Fix blurry text in center stage, Facebook embed failures, and GPU scroll stress
* Fix listener leaks: message listener, resize handler, and drag handler
* Fix full screen mode layout issues

### Changed

* Reduce layout thrashing: scope pause style, remove forceReflow hack

